# Task 5 Re-review — Fix Round 1 of 5

**Range:** `e815b244c21ff4b570c25d7f49d47b1fc167efee..278d41bcc02d88302d0b817ce06eab04d33ac4fe`  
**Verdict:** **NEEDS FIXES**  
**Open findings:** Critical 0, Important 3, Minor 2

This was a read-only review except for this requested artifact. No network, provider, pricing, replay, real Docker, background process, or broad test suite was used.

